sequenceDiagram
 actor P as Patient
 participant UI as Web frontend
 participant A as AuthService
 participant S as AppointmentService
 participant R as AppointmentRepository
 P->>UI: Cancel appointment
 UI->>A: requireRole(token, patient)
 A-->>UI: authenticated patientId
 UI->>S: cancel(patientId, appointmentId)
 S->>R: begin()
 S->>R: lockAppointment(appointmentId)
 R-->>S: owner, status, slot, start time
 alt Own confirmed future appointment
  S->>R: saveCancellation(appointmentId)
  S->>R: releaseSlot(slotId)
  S->>R: commit()
  S-->>UI: cancelled
  UI-->>P: Show cancellation and retain history
 else Unauthorized or ineligible
  S->>R: rollback()
  S-->>UI: access denied or invalid state
  UI-->>P: Explain why cancellation failed
 end
